. La aplicaci\u00f3n cuenta con una interfaz clara y accesible, f\u00e1cil de navegar con las gafas puestas. Crea, edita y elimina alarmas con gestos sencillos y disfruta de notificaciones visuales y sonoras claras que te garantizan que nunca te pierdas un momento importante, ya sea que est\u00e9s jugando, trabajando o relaj\u00e1ndote en RV.", "short_description": "Esta alarma tiene: Temporizador, Cron\u00f3metro y alarma de conversi\u00f3n."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "portrait.png", "id": "2905496342955542", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_PORTRAIT", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/507823984_2905496346288875_7146297178865334511_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=x0bI80UvvGQQ7kNvwFCvQas&_nc_oc=AdpsrqEisB1D2tqIOWY6k5mhvmDJC5SnD8mTQKjjUc7kkiP9QyBQxaqRIrPK2Mx3fRY&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQAPPWTe3JcGgYJ8Dx1EJBgzVdImFiRQOUFzFh4pYIdZkg&oe=6A5B793E"}, {"file_name": "icono-512.png", "id": "2243906042732063", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499618482_2243906046065396_1094352884120925797_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=KhtPi_zuvN4Q7kNvwHBQaik&_nc_oc=AdplnFAO_vn9wS_Gwv-d74YL6RgMUFyGsrmX9Dr3KB1o8ovCBpaur3HCXx69C4ObUq0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQBhUF2FCa9XhoZDty4qWnGBAU03mxfXxfSVpkWlR70GHg&oe=6A5B8FDE"}, {"file_name": "square.png", "id": "1745867016009353", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491831056_1745867019342686_1501165532938032609_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=b_DK1QCogY0Q7kNvwFAeqWd&_nc_oc=AdoESNBX8Uyju7QmNwGW8RZqoAoS5wEIgiSNljUpPe-w59DUEzgPyg3t310fVYTftbo&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQDkl1lVcXtHt3TB8fWjsAGZZNaMZRq-EUhzTMveatiKIA&oe=6A5B855B"}, {"file_name": "hero cover.png", "id": "1368705761087761", "image_type": "APP_IMG_HERO", "uri": "https://sco